    <item>
      <title>Multi-Hop XAI</title>
      <link>https://example.com/project/multi-hop-xai/</link>
      <pubDate>Tue, 25 Aug 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid>https://example.com/project/multi-hop-xai/</guid>
      <description>&lt;h2 id=&#34;overview&#34;&gt;Overview&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Designed a four-layer conceptual framework for multi-hop explainable AI in clinical decision support and implemented it as System C — a 3-hop reasoning pipeline for identification, confirmation, and management.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The system was verified against a guideline knowledge base spanning six clinical conditions, achieving 91% guideline-consistency verification, 100% rejection of out-of-scope cases, and 100% discrimination on a controlled ground-truth test across 56 real clinical notes. Its reliability was also validated through a 36-rater human evaluation focused on clarity and trust.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&#34;tools&#34;&gt;Tools&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Python, LLM-based reasoning and verification, ChromaDB, Sentence-Transformers, RAG pipeline design&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&#34;project-link&#34;&gt;Project Link&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;https://github.com/reshmi-29/Multi-Hop-Explainable-AI-for-Clinical-Decision-Support&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;&gt;GitHub Repository&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
</description>
    </item>
    
    <item>
      <title>Fake-Review-Detection</title>
      <link>https://example.com/project/fake-review-detection/</link>
      <pubDate>Sat, 01 Aug 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid>https://example.com/project/fake-review-detection/</guid>
      <description>&lt;h2 id=&#34;overview&#34;&gt;Overview&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Developed an explainable ML system for detecting fake product reviews using TF-IDF and review metadata, with optimized ensemble classifiers and SHAP/LIME-based model interpretability.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&#34;tools&#34;&gt;Tools&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Python, Scikit-learn, XGBoost, NLTK, SHAP, LIME, Pandas, NumPy, Gradio&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&#34;project-link&#34;&gt;Project Link&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;https://github.com/reshmi-29/Explainable-Fake-Review-Detection&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;&gt;GitHub Repository&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
</description>
    </item>
    
